<title>UK: Daya Guna sets $225 mln 10-yr bond, call.</title>
<headline>Daya Guna sets $225 mln 10-yr bond, call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following callable bond was announced by lead manager Bankers Trust.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DGS INTERNATIONAL FINANCE CO BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  PT DAYA GUNA SAMUDERA</p>
<p> AMT	  $225 MLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY   *01.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    28.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD     +335-345BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER. *CALL AT PAR ON 01.JUN.02.</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  INDONESIA TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.625 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 15.MAY.07.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
